{
  "bodyHash": "98bec11fc4764fa0",
  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\">这是我制作的第一款模组，如果更新有延迟，敬请谅解</p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308304/description_77ed8216-5925-4ad9-b9ae-b2d8f8754b1e.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" height=\"450\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">该模组正在开发中，目前添加的内容包括以下植物：</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">植物大战僵尸宇宙（PvZ Universe）和植物大战僵尸融合版（PvZ Fusion，即将进行重构），以及更多内容</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">此外还有一些<span style=\"color:#3598db\">物品 <span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">和植物</span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#ba372a\">⚠️ 1.0.6 之前的版本需要 Geckolib！！</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_dd6565e5-6774-441e-9b65-e52bc52ae2fa.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"168\" height=\"168\"></span></a></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#01ff0f\">新版本（重构版）：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#01ff0f\">添加了叶片。使用这些叶片，你可以在合成表中合成植物的种子包</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#01ff0f\">豌豆叶</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#01ff0f\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308304/description_e5c2609b-b0c9-4bb4-a0a8-d798a77cbe6d.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"140\" height=\"140\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#00e4ff\">冰叶</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#01ff0f\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308304/description_8650210e-4e34-455b-b7aa-b82d9d68b710.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"140\" height=\"140\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#673b00\">防御叶</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#01ff0f\"><img style=\"font-weight:400;color:#bdff19\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308304/description_6bba06b2-8bac-4714-9380-cfb42d033de7.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"142\" height=\"142\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#bf0000\">爆炸叶</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#01ff0f\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308304/description_b0cdbb6e-4ccd-4252-98ba-c31f88986e70.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"149\" height=\"149\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#a4ffde\">闪电叶</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308304/description_558551b9-0f5a-414a-b587-13f963612ef2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"137\" height=\"137\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f81900\">火焰叶</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308304/description_a66f9ad9-c404-4c3b-b7b3-f39be3f8f72e.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"134\" height=\"134\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#7701fd\">剧毒叶</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#7701fd\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308304/description_6699c478-a69e-4c72-8cd1-c2f16547fd99.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"132\" height=\"132\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#169179\">进攻叶：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#169179\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308304/description_267adc75-6ace-45b4-bac2-e2e1505e731e.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"134\" height=\"134\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#bdff19\">白天植物 ☀️：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<ul>\n<li style=\"color:#009d1b\"><span style=\"color:#009d1b\">豌豆射手</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308304/description_b9ef10e5-3fe6-4945-b6f5-2da02520e346.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"440\" height=\"523\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"color:#fd0\"><span style=\"color:#fd0\">向日葵</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#fd0\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308304/description_c824f037-0adc-4c23-a522-ce1a8f2ac008.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"481\" height=\"515\"></span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#ee083c\"><span style=\"color:#ee083c\">樱桃炸弹：</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fd0\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308304/description_221b2a25-d0a4-4dd4-acf2-0e5b9ab2f0ff.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"530\" height=\"520\"></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"color:#ffc56e\"><span style=\"color:#ffc56e\">土豆地雷</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"color:#ffc56e\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308304/description_12ead729-b3fb-4b9c-975d-c2bd5e1c3846.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"471\" height=\"455\"></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"color:#00e4ff\"><span style=\"color:#00e4ff\">寒冰射手</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"color:#00e4ff\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308304/description_63ffc71d-7508-4ccb-9b78-2536a9e0f4c9.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"502\" height=\"485\"></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"color:#cf5dff\"><span style=\"color:#cf5dff\">大嘴花</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"color:#cf5dff\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308304/description_92dd0b33-d63b-4b03-81a5-d6cb13d7b8d3.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"535\" height=\"517\"></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"color:#009d1b\"><span style=\"color:#009d1b\">双发射手</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"color:#009d1b\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308304/description_b0b15283-4a37-4c0b-b2df-36be8df4a47e.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"497\" height=\"480\"></span></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#283bab\">夜晚植物 🌙：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<ul>\n<li style=\"color:#843fa1\"><span style=\"color:#843fa1\">小喷菇</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"color:#843fa1\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308304/description_b8f89dc1-6022-4013-8cf5-31bdc4fa509c.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"442\" height=\"427\"></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"color:#fd0\"><span style=\"color:#fd0\">阳光菇</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fd0\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308304/description_0fa8b98d-e0ab-4388-a9ff-247dfa8f0e16.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"483\" height=\"467\"></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"color:#843fa1\"><span style=\"color:#843fa1\">大喷菇：</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"color:#843fa1\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308304/description_1b787277-35cd-4850-b22d-e6a03a5fdd47.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"491\" height=\"435\"></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"color:#7701fd\"><span style=\"color:#7701fd\">毁灭菇：</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"color:#843fa1\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308304/description_11580137-76d4-452b-b443-8c540f1c05b5.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"541\" height=\"466\"></span></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#ff06e4\">特殊植物✨：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<ul>\n<li style=\"color:#449b0e\"><span style=\"color:#449b0e\">三头豌豆射手：</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"color:#449b0e\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308304/description_34b24d87-bb35-477c-a1d4-0268cac5dbef.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"473\" height=\"408\"></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">双子向日葵：</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308304/description_857dc228-063a-4dc1-bd15-c0a580cf64ca.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"571\" height=\"492\"></span></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#ffdf70\">高级植物 ✨：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<ul>\n<li style=\"color:#b9ffea\"><span style=\"color:#b9ffea\">电击豌豆射手：</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"color:#b9ffea\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308304/description_d3ab7613-4198-45b7-b4c8-f9582e19a0e9.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"435\" height=\"385\"></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"color:#c72976\"><span style=\"color:#c72976\">流星花：</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"color:#b9ffea\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308304/description_9773b100-afaa-493d-9987-a7e066ebb884.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"530\" height=\"520\"></span></p>\n</div>\n<p><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">旧版本：</span></p><ul>\n<li>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color:#843fa1\">Amet</span><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">rine</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>這是一種將在洞穴中生成的新礦物</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_e7bafb6a-a998-4401-ac54-99e3f1a114e1.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<ul>\n<li>稅收</li>\n</ul>\n<p>這個模組也致敬了一些給了我靈感的朋友們</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">植物</span> 已添加</li>\n</ul>\n<p>模組目前已包含以下植物：</p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"color:#fff90d\"><span style=\"color:#fff90d\">日間植物 ☀️ :</span></li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<ul>\n<li style=\"color:#2dc26b\">豌豆射手</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308304/description_06b4f9a8-27b8-4e76-bae6-f539a44cb447.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"347\" height=\"330\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">向日葵</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308304/description_e0fa0280-2bde-4e51-937c-392aa7827df2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"418\" height=\"421\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"color:#ba372a\"><span style=\"color:#ba372a\">櫻桃炸彈</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_c526bcf5-11f2-4c2a-a9a9-5f5b78b22bf9.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"414\" height=\"381\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"color:#766c3d\"><span style=\"color:#766c3d\">土豆雷</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_261e35e7-a4f0-4ce2-a5b1-91c725f55d99.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"397\" height=\"308\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"color:#7b642c\"><span style=\"color:#7b642c\">坚果墙</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_f9149edb-ce27-4911-afc5-056cfb1b6837.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"383\" height=\"327\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"color:#3598db\">寒冰射手</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308304/description_0cd5d657-5971-45c4-9118-2072d0aa7745.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"376\" height=\"321\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"color:#843fa1\">大嘴花</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308304/description_434eac99-6d1e-4248-9dc7-f945751a49ba.png\" width=\"385\" height=\"419\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">双发射手</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308304/description_18cec15c-2222-4167-8801-a45f66292fac.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"376\" height=\"321\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color:#236fa1\">夜间植物 🌙:</span></li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<ul>\n<li style=\"color:#b700ff\"><span style=\"color:#b700ff\">小喷菇</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308304/description_285fb3ba-dc72-402c-bce1-4b72a3ccb305.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"322\" height=\"281\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"color:#f1c40f\">阳光菇</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308304/description_37f93f76-9a5c-4d02-a184-45734e782d85.png\" width=\"303\" height=\"309\"></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"color:#b700ff\"><span style=\"color:#b700ff\">胆小菇</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308304/description_acdf7f0e-6ab9-4dd7-85ec-372775c4a928.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"369\" height=\"409\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"color:#b700ff\"><span style=\"color:#b700ff\">烟幕菇</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308304/description_6714bb02-4474-49e9-ba77-58d040fbb9db.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"449\" height=\"381\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"color:#34495e\"><span style=\"color:#34495e\">毁灭菇</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_c177c6cb-4e20-4f7c-b479-3c1b21790b62.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"305\" height=\"301\"></p>\n<p>（圖片已禁用陰影效果 😔）</p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"color:#eccafa\"><span style=\"color:#eccafa\">魅惑菇</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"color:#eccafa\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308304/description_5289bd6f-70e1-4ec3-a6f3-f58839c39428.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"274\" height=\"324\"></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"color:#c2e0f4\"><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\">冰菇</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308304/description_c9eac7b9-9cb6-4d26-a768-f9a5a03e51b5.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"285\" height=\"304\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color:#40f5f3\">泳池植物 🏖️</span></li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<ul>\n<li style=\"color:#94f954\"><span style=\"color:#94f954\">睡莲</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"color:#00de12\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308304/description_e99c5b3f-54ce-48b5-82bb-9e13bf129183.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"445\" height=\"282\"></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"color:#c2ed8e\"><span style=\"color:#c2ed8e\">窝瓜</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"color:#c2ed8e\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308304/description_a446d828-ccc6-47e4-8d00-7770eddacafc.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"355\" height=\"451\"></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"color:#00de12\"><span style=\"color:#00de12\">高坚果</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"color:#00de12\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308304/description_5a664a9d-ecd0-4859-ad7d-7cec9c5ce6f6.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"390\" height=\"327\"></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"color:#288724\"><span style=\"color:#288724\">缠绕水草</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308304/description_017fa09a-bced-40c0-a480-b8addfbc402d.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"344\" height=\"416\"></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"color:#f00\"><span style=\"color:#f00\">火爆辣椒</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f00\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308304/description_bc74b900-584c-4413-b6aa-4d3bd5694ef8.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"206\" height=\"398\"></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"color:#8f682d\"><span style=\"color:#8f682d\">刺针菇</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"color:#8f682d\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308304/description_b21788d0-1d78-4f4b-a5a9-2869200fee20.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"458\" height=\"319\"></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"color:#875b19\"><span style=\"color:#875b19\"><span style=\"color:#fc970f\">火炬</span>木</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"color:#875b19\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308304/description_305a2988-ca66-4f8e-a04d-17678187c5ea.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"378\" height=\"357\"></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"color:#ab801a\"><span style=\"color:#ab801a\">核桃壳</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"color:#ab801a\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308304/description_3d9ebe1a-c980-4dc9-ba64-2d0cb0ddedb6.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"317\" height=\"488\"></span></p>\n</div>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"color:#4c1ea2\"><span style=\"color:#4c1ea2\">雾天植物 🌨️🌙:</span></li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<ul>\n<li style=\"color:#288724\"><span style=\"color:#288724\">海蘑菇:</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"color:#288724\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308304/description_91726e9d-4c7e-45d8-a173-f451a826c9fc.png\" width=\"336\" height=\"334\"></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"color:#fff12c\"><span style=\"color:#fff12c\">路灯花</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fff12c\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308304/description_498725cc-5ea6-4975-b17e-3d2d4cdeb502.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"383\" height=\"429\"></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"color:#396525\"><span style=\"color:#396525\">仙人掌</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"color:#396525\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308304/description_6e44e540-a431-45f4-bd28-d4f485fd69f5.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"460\" height=\"414\"></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"color:#449f1a\"><span style=\"color:#449f1a\">吹风机</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"color:#449f1a\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308304/description_84091131-3f25-44ef-a92b-9e201409b94a.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"304\" height=\"360\"></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">三线射手</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308304/description_da5080ad-200c-4709-a134-bbca6e516230.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"369\" height=\"339\"></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">杨桃</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308304/description_386b5c86-8a24-4c41-b2a8-a19daee3d6f1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"354\" height=\"322\"></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"color:#e67e23\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\">南瓜头</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308304/description_a18eaaac-56ad-4afa-8c82-9acadcdaca4a.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"505\" height=\"295\"></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">磁力<span style=\"color:#b96ad9\">菇</span></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308304/description_533855ec-f378-48be-9c53-4d1a13eb46fc.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"351\" height=\"354\"></span></span></p>\n</div>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color:#e80dff\">特殊植物 ⭐:</span></li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<ul>\n<li style=\"color:#e80dff\"><span style=\"color:#e80dff\">加特林豌豆</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"color:#00ff14\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308304/description_0c217097-c85d-461d-adbd-3a287b5e28c5.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"389\" height=\"382\"></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"color:#e80dff\"><span style=\"color:#e80dff\">双子向日葵</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"color:#c20dff\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308304/description_1d863a25-9a84-4689-8c4d-98479a436d3f.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"470\" height=\"367\"></span></p>\n</div>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">植物大戰殭屍</span> <span style=\"color:#b96ad9\">融合</span> 植物</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<ul>\n<li style=\"color:#e62715\"><span style=\"color:#e62715\">爆炸射手</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308304/description_1d5b8a1a-bbd6-4491-9392-76d08476916c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"288\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"color:#169179\">豌豆突击队</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308304/description_4ca8d4c8-2898-45d5-aeb2-29b91f912616.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"474\" height=\"424\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"color:#169179\"><span style=\"color:#169179\">泰坦豌豆炮台</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308304/description_b36a5f52-779b-4ae8-b55b-f6e0776a3e94.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"469\" height=\"419\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">狙击豌豆</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308304/description_8c8bd310-7499-421f-ab4a-c249502865e8.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"517\" height=\"274\"></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"color:#e67e23\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\">烈焰豌豆</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308304/description_c0457c81-f6fc-49ca-bdc8-0510f649e9b5.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"507\" height=\"357\"></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">豌豆向日葵</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308304/description_d97b975b-bc68-410e-862f-6e0a6b64a62e.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"387\" height=\"408\"></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"color:#3598db\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\">寒冰突击队</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308304/description_613fe6a1-4b31-4494-8679-ab8d1fefb045.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"526\" height=\"395\"></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">双子阳光坚果</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308304/description_7493cb6c-53d3-47d8-8fd4-bb5254706f68.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"308\" height=\"301\"></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"color:#c20dff\"><span style=\"color:#c20dff\">食人魔</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308304/description_45dd6c7b-820f-4ed7-b501-d06dd2489a13.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"446\" height=\"346\"></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"color:#e62715\"><span style=\"color:#e62715\"><span style=\"color:#34495e\">加特林</span>樱桃炸弹</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"color:#e62715\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308304/description_83ad59e9-1694-4b3b-8fa7-c27870b3561d.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"411\" height=\"353\"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"color:#34495e\"><span style=\"color:#34495e\">加特林<span style=\"color:#7120a7\">毁灭</span></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"color:#34495e\"><span style=\"color:#7120a7\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308304/description_1356631a-e00c-4d48-ba41-98e736cca958.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"405\" height=\"350\"></span></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"color:#1ae5d7\"><span style=\"color:#1ae5d7\">加特林冰锥菇</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"color:#1ae5d7\"><span style=\"color:#f00\"><span style=\"color:#f40\"><span style=\"color:#ff7400\"><span style=\"color:#ffc500\"><span style=\"color:#ef0\"><span style=\"color:#b8ff00\"><span style=\"color:#7aff00\"><span style=\"color:#00ff14\"><span style=\"color:#0f8\"><span style=\"color:#00ffd3\"><span style=\"color:#00e0ff\"><span style=\"color:#00a3ff\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308304/description_3d6bf158-e76f-4301-ae44-45962ae71dc3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"302\" height=\"246\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"color:#00daff\"><span style=\"color:#00daff\">霜冻菇</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"color:#00a3ff\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308304/description_780f2cd5-80f8-4c3f-8c03-96ff3746ad3d.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"382\" height=\"345\"></span></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#ff26eb\">光谱植物 ⚡</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<ul>\n<li style=\"color:#ff8405\"><span style=\"color:#ff8405\">太阳耀斑</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f00\"><span style=\"color:#ff5f00\"><span style=\"color:#ffd300\"><span style=\"color:#a3ff00\"><span style=\"color:#4f0\"><span style=\"color:#00ff8f\"><span style=\"color:#00ffe7\"><span style=\"color:#00daff\"><span style=\"color:#009cff\"><span style=\"color:#0058ff\"><span style=\"color:#00f\"><span style=\"color:#5200ff\"><span style=\"color:#80f\"><span style=\"color:#b100ff\"><span style=\"color:#da00ff\"><span style=\"color:#ff00fc\"><span style=\"color:#f0c\"><span style=\"color:#ff009c\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308304/description_9b7f2bf8-695b-46dd-bbf7-72cb89bf9432.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"372\" height=\"411\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"color:#ffd300\"><span style=\"color:#ffd300\">日蚀卷心菜</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f00\"><span style=\"color:#f40\"><span style=\"color:#ff7400\"><span style=\"color:#ffc500\"><span style=\"color:#ef0\"><span style=\"color:#b8ff00\"><span style=\"color:#7aff00\"><span style=\"color:#00ff14\"><span style=\"color:#0f8\"><span style=\"color:#00ffd3\"><span style=\"color:#00e0ff\"><span style=\"color:#00a3ff\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308304/description_4896e185-b805-4bc1-a68b-74516cf58494.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"413\" height=\"349\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"color:#1ae5d7\"><span style=\"color:#1ae5d7\">狙击冰锥菇</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f00\"><span style=\"color:#f40\"><span style=\"color:#ff7400\"><span style=\"color:#ffc500\"><span style=\"color:#ef0\"><span style=\"color:#b8ff00\"><span style=\"color:#7aff00\"><span style=\"color:#00ff14\"><span style=\"color:#0f8\"><span style=\"color:#00ffd3\"><span style=\"color:#00e0ff\"><span style=\"color:#00a3ff\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308304/description_1b66c99b-7a8f-45a7-ad77-f0c37ff1b2e4.png\" width=\"270\" height=\"202\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<ul>\n<li>未來內容</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</li>\n</ul><p>我計劃重新紋理一些植物。</p>\n<p>這會持續更新，由於我獨自進行這項工作，我會盡量頻繁地發布更新 :) </p>",
